  "body": "**Link to problem area**:\r\n\r\n[/rooms/{roomId}/context/{eventId}](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.8/client-server-api/#get_matrixclientv3roomsroomidcontexteventid)\r\n\r\n[/rooms/{roomId}/messages](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.8/client-server-api/#get_matrixclientv3roomsroomidmessages)\r\n\r\n[/sync](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.8/client-server-api/#get_matrixclientv3sync)\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\n\r\n- `state` in `/context` is the state of the room at the last event returned\r\n- `state` in `/sync` is start of the returned timeline (first event returned) \r\n- `state` in `/messages` seems to be undefined?\r\n\r\nThese are all different, and `/messages` is undefined?\r\n",
